OL,3,GNEWSASwinney visits 'crisis' towns
OL,4,Aasking for help after 1,500 job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney is facing calls for
OL,7,Fgovernment action to support one of
OL,8,FScotland's smallest council areas as it
OL,9,Fstruggles with the cumulative loss of
OL,10,F1,500 jobs.
OL,12,FThe first minister will spend much of
OL,13,Fthe day touring Inverclyde at the
OL,14,Finvitation of the local authority to
OL,15,Fsee for himself the special challenges
OL,16,Ffacing the region.
OL,18,FCouncil leader Stephen McCabe says a
OL,19,Fdrip feed of closures has left the area
OL,20,Ffacing a desperate jobs crisis, on top
OL,21,Fof years of deindustrialisation and
OL,22,Fdepopulation.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
