OL,3,GNEWSASwinney visits 'crisis' towns
OL,4,Aasking for help after 1,500 job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney will meet local politicians and
OL,7,Fa community group as well as managers
OL,8,Ffrom the nationalised Ferguson
OL,9,Fshipyard, a week after they announced
OL,10,Fplans to shed a quarter of its
OL,11,Fworkforce.
